message: "If you use WenWen in research, teaching, or reporting, cite this repository."
title: "WenWen: a local-first Windows file and invoice organizer"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Fu"
    given-names: "Harrison"
repository-code: "https://github.com/harrisonfu8-design/wenwen-open-source"
url: "https://sw.olilily.com/en/"
license: other
