version: 1.5.20
date-released: 2026-11-22
abstract: >-
  WenWen is a Windows desktop application for content-aware file filing,
  local search, an archive audit trail, and an invoice ledger with duplicate
  detection and Excel export. The public repository is semi-open: UI shell,
  installer, documentation, and client licensing/support UI are published,
  while the core recognition and invoice/OCR algorithms and the hosted backend
  are closed source.
keywords:
  - file organizer
  - invoice management
  - document management
  - desktop application
  - Windows
  - Python
  - local-first
  - semi-open source
